 <text type="manuscript">
  <body>
   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="uva.00147.001.jpg" type="recto"/>
   
   <note type="archival" place="top" hand="#h02" rend="underline">1</note>
   <lg type="poem">
     <head rend="underline">As I sit in Twilight, late, <add place="below"><note type="authorial" rend="underline">?</note> a twilight song</add></head>
     <l>As I sit in twilight, 
      <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a001">late,</add> alone by the 
      <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a002">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a002">flickering</add> oak&#11840;flame,</l>
    <l>Musing on long&#11840;past war&#11840;scenes, &amp; the countless<lb/>
            buried unknown soldiers,</l>
     <l>
      <subst>
       <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">The</del>
       <add place="above" seq="2">of</add>
      </subst>
      vacant names, 
      <subst>
       <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the</del> 
       <add place="above" seq="2">as</add>
      </subst>
      unindented air's and<lb/>
            sea's, the unreturn'd, <del rend="overstrike">from battles</del>,</l>
     <l>The brief truce after, 
      <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a003">the battle,</add> with <del rend="overstrike">the</del> grim burial squads,<lb/>
      and <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">hasty</del> <add place="below" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a004">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a004" seq="2">the deep&#11840;fill'd</add></subst> trenches,</l>
     <addSpan rend="pasteon" spanTo="#a023"/>
    <l>
     <subst>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">The</del>
      <add place="below" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a024">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2" xml:id="a024"><gap reason="illegible" extent="one or two characters"></gap></add></del>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="5"><add place="above" seq="4">With</add></del>
      <add place="above" seq="5">Of</add></subst> 
     <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">serried ranks</del>
      <add place="above" seq="2">gathered dead</add>
     </subst> from 
     <subst>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">all</del>
      <add place="above" seq="2">all</add>
     </subst> 
     America<del rend="overstrike">'s</del> 
     <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a005">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike" seq="2"><add place="above" xml:id="a005" seq="1">best,</add></del> 
     North, South,<lb/>
     East, West,</l>
     <l>From wooded Maine, New England's farms, from<lb/>
           fertile Pennsylvania, Illinois, Ohio,</l>
     <l>The <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a006">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a006">whole</add> measureless West, <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a007">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a007">Virginia,</add> the South, the Carolinas,<lb/>
           Texas</l>
    <anchor xml:id="a023"/>
    
    <addSpan rend="pasteon" spanTo="#a025"/>
     <l>(Even here in my room&#11840;shadows, <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a008">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a008">and half-lights,</add> in the noiseless<lb/>
           flickering flames,</l>
    <l>
     <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a009">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a009">Again</add> I see the ranks on&#11840;filing, 
     <subst><add place="below" seq="4"><metamark function="add" target="a011">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a011" seq="4">rising</add> <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">advancing&#8212;</del><add place="above" seq="2">coming&#8212;</add></subst>I hear the 
     <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a010">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a010">rhythmic</add> tramp<lb/>
          of the <del rend="overstrike">spectral</del> armies,)</l>
    <anchor xml:id="a025"/>
    
    <addSpan rend="pasteon" spanTo="#a026"/>
     <l>You million unwrit names all, all, 
      <subst>
       <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the</del><add place="above" seq="2">&#8212;you</add></subst> 
      dark<lb/>
      bequest, 
      <subst>
       <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the</del>
       <add place="above" seq="2">you</add></subst> 
      <del rend="overstrike">wars</del>
      <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a012">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a012"><del rend="overstrike">pass'd</del> there</add> unknown,</l>
     <l>A special word to you&#8212;a flash of 
      <subst><add place="below" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a013">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" rend="marked" xml:id="a013" seq="2">duty, long&#11840;neglected &#8212;</add> <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">love&#8212;</del></subst> your<lb/>
      <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a014">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike"><add place="above" xml:id="a014">entire</add></del> mystic rolls 
      <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">strangely</del> 
       <add place="above" seq="2"></add>
      </subst> 
      gather'd for once here</l>
    <l>Each name <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a015">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a015">strangely</add> recall'd by me <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a016">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike"><add place="above" xml:id="a016">out</add></del> from 
     <add hand="#h01" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a027">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h01" place="above" xml:id="a027">out</add> the darkness and<lb/>
         death's <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">debris</del> <add seq="2">ashes,</add></subst></l>
    <l>To be 
     <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a017">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a017">from</add> 
     <subst>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">to&#11840;night</del>
      <add place="below" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a028">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" seq="2" xml:id="a028">in the twilight <del rend="overstrike">here</del></add></subst> 
     deep, deep, within my thought <del rend="overstrike">henceforth</del><lb/>
     record<subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">ed</del><add place="above" seq="2">ing</add></subst> 
     <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a018">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a018">here,</add>&#8212;<add place="above"><metamark function="add">&#182;</metamark></add><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the</del><add place="above" seq="2">your</add></subst> myriad 
     <subst>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">and</del>
      <add place="below" seq="2">roll of</add></subst> 
     unknown 
     <subst>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">army,</del>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">ranks</add></del>
      <add place="below" seq="4"><metamark function="add" target="#a019">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a019" seq="4">names</add>
     </subst> 
     <del rend="overstrike">or</del><lb/>
          North or South,</l>
    <l>
     <add place="below">
      <metamark function="add" target="#a020">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" rend="marked" xml:id="a020" seq="1">Henceforth</add>
     <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above"><gap reason="illegible" extent="about three characters"/> <unclear reason="illegible" cert="medium" resp="#tb">last</unclear></add></del> Embalm'd 
     <add place="below">
      <metamark function="add" target="#a021">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a021">with love</add> 
     in this 
     <subst>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">brief</del>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">brief</add></del>
     </subst>
     <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a022">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a022">twilight</add> song.</l>
   </lg>
   
   <signed rend="doubleUnderline">Walt Whitman</signed>
   <anchor xml:id="a026"/>
   <pb xml:id="leaf001v" facs="uva_jc.00020_large.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
</body>
